{"name":"Droëwors","hex":"#523839","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[],"entries":[{"title":"Droëwors","blocks":[{"text":"Droëwors is a Southern African snack food, based on the traditional, coriander-seed spiced boerewors sausage. It is usually made as a dunwors rather than dikwors, as the thinner sausage dries more quickly and is thus less likely to spoil before it can be preserved. If dikwors is to be used, it is usually flattened to provide a larger surface area for drying."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Droewors2.jpg/330px-Droewors2.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dro%C3%ABwors"}],"images":[],"sounds":{},"pictures":[{"title":"Brown ornaments on doors, Reflections, Rostov-on-Don, Russia","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a0/Brown_ornaments_on_doors%2C_Reflections%2C_Rostov-on-Don%2C_Russia.jpg/500px-Brown_ornaments_on_doors%2C_Reflections%2C_Rostov-on-Don%2C_Russia.jpg","ratio":1.5,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Brown_ornaments_on_doors,_Reflections,_Rostov-on-Don,_Russia.jpg","share":0.3475},{"title":"Brown and beige, Computer desk, Rostov-on-Don, Russia","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9f/Brown_and_beige%2C_Computer_desk%2C_Rostov-on-Don%2C_Russia.jpg/500px-Brown_and_beige%2C_Computer_desk%2C_Rostov-on-Don%2C_Russia.jpg","ratio":1.5049019607843137,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Brown_and_beige,_Computer_desk,_Rostov-on-Don,_Russia.jpg","share":0.19125},{"title":"Droewors2","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/54/Droewors2.jpg/500px-Droewors2.jpg","ratio":1.3333333333333333,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Droewors2.jpg","share":0.138125},{"title":"Biltong Somerset Mall","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Biltong_Somerset_Mall.jpg/500px-Biltong_Somerset_Mall.jpg","ratio":